{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2021-08-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH PARTNERS WITH ABBOTT AND QUIDEL TO OFFER RAPID OTC COVID-19 TESTS', 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO, AUG. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARDINAL HEALTH (NYSE: CAH) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS EFFORTS TO COMMERCIALIZE AND BROADEN ACCESS TO OVER-THE-COUNTER RAPID COVID-19 TESTS THROUGH PARTNERSHIPS WITH ABBOTT AND QUIDEL CORPORATION ("QUIDEL"). CARDINAL HEALTH WILL LEVERAGE ITS EXPANSIVE DISTRIBUTION NETWORK TO SUPPORT BROAD ACCESS TO QUIDEL\'S QUICKVUE® AT-HOME OTC COVID-19 TEST AND ABBOTT\'S BINAXNOW™ COVID-19 ANTIGEN SELF-TEST, WHICH ALLOW CONSUMERS TO EASILY PERFORM TESTS FOR THE VIRUS WITHOUT A PRESCRIPTION.'}